{"id":"cfa58c8c6fd97f93","group":"27","path":"27/27-validation-2026-10-16.md","title":"缺失验证链接的内部依赖闭合摘要","display":"缺失验证链接的内部依赖闭合摘要","type":"index","metadata":{"type":"index","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-validation-2026-10-16","aliases":["27-validation-2026-10-16"],"display":"缺失验证链接的内部依赖闭合摘要","depends_on":["[[27-MOC]]"],"verification_status":"reconstructed-internal-summary-from-supplied-files","local_review_date":"2026-10-20","historical_original_supplied":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"index"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-validation-2026-10-16"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-validation-2026-10-16</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"缺失验证链接的内部依赖闭合摘要"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5244dbb38da17b8a\" href=\"?note=5244dbb38da17b8a\" title=\"27-MOC\">27-MOC</a></span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reconstructed-internal-summary-from-supplied-files"},{"key":"local_review_date","html":"2026-10-20"},{"key":"historical_original_supplied","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>本节点补齐 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5244dbb38da17b8a\" href=\"?note=5244dbb38da17b8a\" title=\"27-MOC\">27-MOC</a> 所列的历史验证链接；原始日志未提供。本条记录2026-10-20对完整修订目录的检查。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\">\\(\\mathcal F\\)</span> 为该目录的文件标识集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\times\\mathcal F\">\\(E\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\times\\mathcal F\\)</span> 为 frontmatter 的 depends_on 关系。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 为全目录中所有双括号链接的缺失目标集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 为全部双括号链接中不以27开头的目标集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 为 depends_on 有向环上出现的顶点集合。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"o\\in\\{0,1\\}\">\\(o\\in\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 表示原始历史日志是否提供，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 表示提供。原书 source_file 字段只作来源记录，不是本条的依赖边。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"o\\coloneqq0,\\qquad|\\mathcal F|=459.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[o\\coloneqq0,\\qquad|\\mathcal F|=459.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"B=X=C=\\varnothing,\\qquad E\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\times\\mathcal F.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[B=X=C=\\varnothing,\\qquad E\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\times\\mathcal F.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>依赖闭合针对应用补丁后的完整第27本书目录检查；仅包含修改文件的交付包本身允许引用原目录中保留的文件。数学依赖均在27内，恢复历史摘要后原来的八个导航悬空目标也存在。</p>\n<p>链接可解析与依赖无环是文本结构性质，不代替数学证明，更不证明旧来源字段所指的外部书页曾被本次访问。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-MOC","status":"resolved","id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-MOC]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-MOC","status":"resolved","id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本节点补齐 [[27-MOC]] 所列的历史验证链接；原始日志未提供。本条记录2026-10-20对完整修订目录的检查。$\\mathcal F$ 为该目录的文件标识集合；$E\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\times\\mathcal F$ 为 frontmatter 的 depends_on 关系。$B$ 为全目录中所有双括号链接的缺失目标集合；$X$ 为全部双括号链接中不以27开头的目标集合；$C$ 为 depends_on 有向环上出现的顶点集合。$o\\in\\{0,1\\}$ 表示原始历史日志是否提供，$1$ 表示提供。原书 source_file 字段只作来源记录，不是本条的依赖边。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"te